2. NAT Network (Default)
2.1. Cách hoạt động
VM (192.168.122.100)
    │
    │ vNIC (virtio)
    ↓
virbr0 (192.168.122.1/24) ── Linux bridge
    │
    │ iptables MASQUERADE (NAT)
    ↓
Host NIC (enp1s0, 10.0.0.5) → Physical Network → Internet


libvirt tạo bridge virbr0 + chạy dnsmasq (DHCP + DNS)
VM nhận IP từ DHCP range (192.168.122.2 - 254)
Outbound traffic: NAT qua host IP
Inbound traffic: cần port forwarding




                   Fedora 39+: nftables thay iptables



Trên Fedora mới, libvirt dùng nftables backend thay vì iptables cho NAT rules. iptables commands vẫn hoạt động qua compatibility layer nhưng nft list ruleset | head -50 cho kết quả chính xác hơn.


2.2. Tạo NAT network
# Network default đã có sẵn. Tạo thêm:
cat &gt; /tmp/nat-network.xml &lt;&lt;&#039;EOF&#039;
&lt;network&gt;
  &lt;name&gt;lab-nat&lt;/name&gt;
  &lt;forward mode=&#039;nat&#039;&gt;
    &lt;nat&gt;
      &lt;port start=&#039;1024&#039; end=&#039;65535&#039;/&gt;
    &lt;/nat&gt;
  &lt;/forward&gt;
  &lt;bridge name=&#039;virbr1&#039; stp=&#039;on&#039; delay=&#039;0&#039;/&gt;
  &lt;ip address=&#039;10.10.10.1&#039; netmask=&#039;255.255.255.0&#039;&gt;
    &lt;dhcp&gt;
      &lt;range start=&#039;10.10.10.100&#039; end=&#039;10.10.10.200&#039;/&gt;
      &lt;host mac=&#039;52:54:00:aa:bb:01&#039; name=&#039;vm1&#039; ip=&#039;10.10.10.11&#039;/&gt;
      &lt;host mac=&#039;52:54:00:aa:bb:02&#039; name=&#039;vm2&#039; ip=&#039;10.10.10.12&#039;/&gt;
    &lt;/dhcp&gt;
  &lt;/ip&gt;
&lt;/network&gt;
EOF

virsh net-define /tmp/nat-network.xml
virsh net-start lab-nat
virsh net-autostart lab-nat
2.3. Static DHCP reservations
# Thêm static lease (VM luôn nhận cùng IP)
virsh net-update default add ip-dhcp-host \
  &quot;&lt;host mac=&#039;52:54:00:ab:cd:ef&#039; name=&#039;webserver&#039; ip=&#039;192.168.122.50&#039;/&gt;&quot; \
  --live --config
2.4. Port forwarding cho NAT
# Dùng firewall-cmd (Fedora)
# Forward host:8080 → VM:80
sudo firewall-cmd --add-forward-port=port=8080:proto=tcp:toport=80:toaddr=192.168.122.50 --permanent
sudo firewall-cmd --reload

# Hoặc dùng iptables trực tiếp
sudo iptables -t nat -A PREROUTING -p tcp --dport 8080 \
  -j DNAT --to-destination 192.168.122.50:80
sudo iptables -I FORWARD -p tcp -d 192.168.122.50 --dport 80 -j ACCEPT

# Hoặc dùng libvirt hooks (tự động khi VM start/stop)
# Xem [[02 - libvirt và QEMU#5.2. Hooks]]

3. Bridge Network
3.1. Cách hoạt động
VM (10.0.0.100)                VM có IP cùng subnet
    │                          với host và LAN devices
    │ vNIC (virtio)            → truy cập từ LAN trực tiếp
    ↓
br0 (bridge) ──── enp1s0 (physical NIC)
    │
    ↓
Physical Switch → LAN (10.0.0.0/24)

3.2. Tạo Bridge với NetworkManager (Fedora)
# 1. Tạo bridge
sudo nmcli connection add type bridge ifname br0 con-name br0 \
  ipv4.method manual \
  ipv4.addresses 10.0.0.5/24 \
  ipv4.gateway 10.0.0.1 \
  ipv4.dns &quot;8.8.8.8 1.1.1.1&quot;

# 2. Gán physical NIC làm slave
sudo nmcli connection add type bridge-slave ifname enp1s0 master br0

# 3. Hạ connection cũ của physical NIC
sudo nmcli connection down &quot;Wired connection 1&quot;

# 4. Bật bridge
sudo nmcli connection up br0

# 5. Verify
ip addr show br0
bridge link show



                   Cẩn thận khi tạo bridge qua SSH



Khi chuyển physical NIC vào bridge, bạn có thể mất kết nối SSH tạm thời. Nên thực hiện qua console hoặc dùng script chạy tất cả commands liên tiếp.


3.3. libvirt XML cho bridge
&lt;!-- Trong VM domain XML --&gt;
&lt;interface type=&#039;bridge&#039;&gt;
  &lt;source bridge=&#039;br0&#039;/&gt;
  &lt;model type=&#039;virtio&#039;/&gt;
  &lt;mac address=&#039;52:54:00:ab:cd:ef&#039;/&gt;
&lt;/interface&gt;
# Attach bridge interface vào VM
virsh attach-interface myvm bridge br0 --model virtio --live --config
3.4. Bridge network definition trong libvirt (optional)
# Có thể define bridge network trong libvirt (cho consistency)
cat &gt; /tmp/bridge-network.xml &lt;&lt;&#039;EOF&#039;
&lt;network&gt;
  &lt;name&gt;host-bridge&lt;/name&gt;
  &lt;forward mode=&#039;bridge&#039;/&gt;
  &lt;bridge name=&#039;br0&#039;/&gt;
&lt;/network&gt;
EOF

virsh net-define /tmp/bridge-network.xml
virsh net-start host-bridge
virsh net-autostart host-bridge

# Dùng trong VM:
# --network network=host-bridge,model=virtio

4. Isolated Network
4.1. Cách hoạt động
VM1 (10.20.30.11) ↔→ VM2 (10.20.30.12) ↔→ VM3 (10.20.30.13)
         │                   │                   │
         └───────── virbr-isolated ──────────────┘
                  (bridge, NO forwarding)
                  VMs nói chuyện với nhau
                  Host có IP trên bridge (10.20.30.1)
                  → Host↔VM: OK qua bridge IP
                  → VM→Internet: KHÔNG

4.2. Tạo Isolated Network
cat &gt; /tmp/isolated.xml &lt;&lt;&#039;EOF&#039;
&lt;network&gt;
  &lt;name&gt;isolated-lab&lt;/name&gt;
  &lt;!-- KHÔNG có &lt;forward&gt; → isolated --&gt;
  &lt;bridge name=&#039;virbr-iso&#039; stp=&#039;on&#039; delay=&#039;0&#039;/&gt;
  &lt;ip address=&#039;10.20.30.1&#039; netmask=&#039;255.255.255.0&#039;&gt;
    &lt;dhcp&gt;
      &lt;range start=&#039;10.20.30.10&#039; end=&#039;10.20.30.50&#039;/&gt;
    &lt;/dhcp&gt;
  &lt;/ip&gt;
&lt;/network&gt;
EOF

virsh net-define /tmp/isolated.xml
virsh net-start isolated-lab
virsh net-autostart isolated-lab



                   Use case: Internal cluster lab



Tạo isolated network cho cluster Kubernetes, database replication, hoặc Morpheus VME internal communication mà không ảnh hưởng LAN.



